[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13823.67, "timestamp": "03:50:23", "text": "鸬鹚，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13849.349, "timestamp": "03:50:49", "text": "植入人体的竟然是一颗严重萎缩的人类心脏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13853.189, "timestamp": "03:50:53", "text": "这是我的判断。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13857.11, "timestamp": "03:50:57", "text": "这个名字源于力量，而“疾行者之门”已经完工。"}]